WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.426 --> 00:00:04.449
Unit twenty. Clean Hands, Clean Screens!

2
00:00:05.355 --> 00:00:10.407
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.457 --> 00:00:13.469
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.519 --> 00:00:18.144
Today we learn about Clean Hands, Clean Screens. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.759 --> 00:00:23.459
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

6
00:00:26.997 --> 00:00:31.025
Hands. Say it with me. Hands!

7
00:00:34.485 --> 00:00:38.211
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

8
00:00:41.711 --> 00:00:45.507
Cloth. Say it with me. Cloth!

9
00:00:49.022 --> 00:00:52.522
Food. Say it with me. Food!

10
00:00:56.032 --> 00:00:59.565
Drink. Say it with me. Drink!

11
00:01:03.101 --> 00:01:06.955
Crumbs. Say it with me. Crumbs!

12
00:01:10.453 --> 00:01:14.334
Care. Say it with me. Care!

13
00:01:17.812 --> 00:01:29.638
I wash my hands before I use a computer or tablet. I keep food and drink away so crumbs and spills do not damage it. A grown-up cleans the screen with a soft cloth.

14
00:01:29.688 --> 00:01:33.276
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:34.024 --> 00:01:39.484
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:40.684
Screen!

17
00:01:41.657 --> 00:01:47.104
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.154 --> 00:01:48.304
Crumbs!

19
00:01:49.294 --> 00:01:55.272
Did you know? A small spill of water can damage the inside of a laptop or keyboard!

20
00:01:55.322 --> 00:01:57.662
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:58.622 --> 00:02:07.894
Think and answer. Why should we keep drinks away from computers?

22
00:02:07.944 --> 00:02:09.225
Great answer!

23
00:02:10.161 --> 00:02:16.207
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:16.257 --> 00:02:19.644
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

